# Used instead of the repo's .dockerignore for the commit image (BuildKit picks
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore). Upstream's drops .git, test/ and scripts needed here: the image
# must carry the full history (the grader reads it) and test/ (pg_regress inputs).
**/*.o
**/*.a
**/*.so
**/__pycache__/
test/tmp_check/
test/results/
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
